ACTION REPORT    

Here's what happened to Your Majesty this turn:

  With the coming of the spring season Neferititi set out to quench her 
thirst for glory.  She prepared her armies to defend Babylon and the 
surrounding provinces.
  A diplomatic furor erupted between the Realms of Neferititi (whose 
alliances are too incompatible) and Xin II (#4), degrading their diplomatic 
relations 1 level(s)!

  Thus endeth the adventures of Neferititi for this year.



